---
const reasons = [
  { t: 'Meetings take the time they need', d: 'A bank appointment is a race against the clock. Ours ends when your questions do.' },
  { t: 'We answer in the evening and on weekends', d: 'Most people can only deal with a mortgage after work. So that is when we work.' },
  { t: 'We tell you when the right move is to wait', d: 'Sometimes the honest advice is not to buy yet. We would rather earn a client next year than a deal today.' },
  { t: 'We have been newcomers ourselves', d: 'We know what a Canadian lender needs to see from a foreign income history, because we have lived it.' },
  { t: 'The product a single bank cannot offer', d: 'A bank sells its own shelf. We have access to 249 lenders through Mortgage Alliance, so the file goes where it fits.' },
  { t: 'You always know what is happening', d: 'Every update, every condition, every next step, explained before you have to ask.' },
];
---
<section class="section why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why people work with us</span>
      <h2 id="why-title">It is more than the rate. It is how the whole thing feels.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="list">
      {reasons.map((r) => (
        <li class="reveal"><h3>{r.t}</h3><p>{r.d}</p></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-6) var(--s-6); }
  li { border-top: 2px solid var(--beige-500); padding-top: var(--s-4); }
  h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: var(--s-2); }
  p { font-size: var(--fs-small); color: var(--text-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .list { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
